 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No motif on the Prophet ﷺ, no people drawn. Light for «ولكن ذكرى», wind for «وغرتهم الحياة الدنيا», a book for «وذكر به» (the Quran). «شراب من حميم وعذاب أليم»: night sky, nothing literal, no fire motif. STAGING v4: c1 (67-69): a sitting of mockers (3 men) in a town; the believers (As-Sa'di: the command is for the Messenger first and his nation after him) turn away at 68:7, refuse to stay at 68:17 and come back to admonish at 69:10 (Al-Muyassar and As-Sa'di: they should admonish them). The conditional 68:14-16 is not acted. The Prophet is not shown. Hourglass on 67:3. c2 (70): the same men in a market at dusk (worldly life, jewel plate on 70:8), believers turn from them (70:1) and remind with the Quran (book, 70:10). The believers leave after the reminder (exit 70:11, before 70:12); during 70:13-31 the camera stays on the wrongdoers; they leave on 70:32 (a neutral word), so the market is empty while their Hereafter outcome (70:34-45) is recited. Nothing literal, no fire."
 },
